        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "The sensitivity for ethionamide resistance in this study ranged from 78% to 100% and the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        527.3130493164062,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "specificity from 97% to 100%.  The pooled sensitivity was 98.0% (95% CI: 74.2–99.9%) and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.99034595489502,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        100.31520080566406,
        365.4900207519531,
        113.22920227050781
      ],
      "text": "the pooled specificity was 99.7% (95% CI: 83.5–100.0%).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        125.11278533935547,
        523.3297119140625,
        139.20079040527344
      ],
      "text": "PICO 4: Should low complexity automated NAATs be used on sputum in people",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.38580322265625,
        139.5128173828125,
        516.1968994140625,
        153.60081481933594
      ],
      "text": "with signs and symptoms of pulmonary TB, and detected resistance to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.38580322265625,
        153.912841796875,
        505.8684997558594,
        168.00083923339844
      ],
      "text": "rifampicin, for detection of resistance to amikacin, as compared with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.38580322265625,
        168.31280517578125,
        290.91143798828125,
        182.4008026123047
      ],
      "text": "culture-based phenotypic DST?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        193.10369873046875,
        526.9039916992188,
        206.2487030029297
      ],
      "text": "One multinational study with 490 participants provided data for evaluating resistance to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        208.60369873046875,
        527.090576171875,
        221.7487030029297
      ],
      "text": "amikacin. The reference standard for this study was culture-based phenotypic DST. Each study",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.998799324035645,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        224.10369873046875,
        463.6589050292969,
        237.2487030029297
      ],
      "text": "centre in this multinational study was analysed as a separate study ( ). Fig. 2.4.1.4",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.10772705078125,
        527.131591796875,
        261.25274658203125
      ],
      "text": "The 95% CI for sensitivity was wide, which could lead to different decisions around true positives",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.990646362304688,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        263.60772705078125,
        526.9657592773438,
        276.75274658203125
      ],
      "text": "and false negatives, depending on which confidence limits are assumed. Also, there were few",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.10772705078125,
        526.5850219726562,
        292.25274658203125
      ],
      "text": "participants with amikacin resistance contributing to this analysis for the observed sensitivity.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        294.60772705078125,
        527.0140380859375,
        307.75274658203125
      ],
      "text": "Consequently, the certainty of the evidence was downgraded two levels for imprecision. Also,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        310.10772705078125,
        526.9660034179688,
        323.25274658203125
      ],
      "text": "there were few participants with amikacin resistance contributing to this analysis for the observed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.956914901733398,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.60760498046875,
        526.8956909179688,
        338.75262451171875
      ],
      "text": "sensitivity. Consequently, the certainty of the evidence was downgraded two levels for imprecision;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        341.10760498046875,
        480.11407470703125,
        354.25262451171875
      ],
      "text": "the quality (certainty) of evidence was rated low for sensitivity and high for specificity.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        368.8939208984375,
        501.8820495605469,
        382.9819030761719
      ],
      "text": "Fig. 2.4.1.4 Forest plot of included studies for amikacin resistance detection",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.3939208984375,
        419.3820495605469,
        398.4819030761719
      ],
      "text": "with culture-based phenotypic DST as the reference standard",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.67132568359375,
        526.5015869140625,
        511.42633056640625
      ],
      "text": "CI: confidence interval; DIAMA: Diagnostics for Multidrug Resistant Tuberculosis in Africa; DST: drug susceptibility",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        511.4712829589844,
        526.5274047851562,
        522.2262573242188
      ],
      "text": "testing; FIND: Foundation for Innovative New Diagnostics; FN: false negative; FP: false positive; TB: tuberculosis;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        522.2713623046875,
        210.4021453857422,
        533.0263061523438
      ],
      "text": "TN: true negative; TP: true positive.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        550.0345458984375,
        526.6019897460938,
        563.1795654296875
      ],
      "text": "The sensitivity for amikacin resistance in this study ranged from 75% to 95% and the specificity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.979631423950195,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        565.5345458984375,
        527.1668090820312,
        578.6795654296875
      ],
      "text": "from 96% to 100%.  The pooled sensitivity was 86.1% (95% CI: 75.0–92.7%) and the pooled",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.948579788208008,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        581.1885375976562,
        299.17108154296875,
        594.1025390625
      ],
      "text": "specificity was 98.9% (95% CI: 93.0–99.8%).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        606.5460815429688,
        246.438720703125,
        622.9260864257812
      ],
      "text": "Cost–effectiveness analysis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.1771240234375,
        340.1640625,
        646.3221435546875
      ],
      "text": "This section answers the following additional question:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.1286010742188,
        462.3529052734375,
        672.2166137695312
      ],
      "text": "What is the comparative cost, affordability and cost–effectiveness of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        672.5286865234375,
        380.65216064453125,
        686.61669921875
      ],
      "text": "implementation of low complexity automated NAATs?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        697.319580078125,
        526.8040771484375,
        710.464599609375
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review was conducted, focusing on economic evaluations of low complexity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        712.819580078125,
        526.969970703125,
        725.964599609375
      ],
      "text": "automated NAATs. Four online databases (Embase, Medline, Web of Science and Scopus) were",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        728.319580078125,
        526.8380126953125,
        741.464599609375
      ],
      "text": "searched for new studies published from 1 January 2010 through 17 September 2020. The",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        743.819580078125,
        527.0919189453125,
        756.964599609375
      ],
      "text": "citations of all eligible articles, guidelines and reviews were reviewed for additional studies. Experts",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        759.319580078125,
        506.2723388671875,
        772.464599609375
      ],
      "text": "and test manufacturers were also contacted to identify any additional unpublished studies.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "76 WHO consolidated",
